#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:5
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuratie"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:8
msgid ""
"Configure Resthome — rooms and sectors, billing rates, supplement types, "
"health insurers, facility and multi-company."
msgstr ""
"Resthome configureren — kamers en sectoren, facturatietarieven, "
"supplementtypes, zorgverzekeraars, instelling en multi-vennootschap."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:20
msgid ""
"Before day-to-day use, a few basic settings give Resthome its structure. "
"They are set up once, then only change at the margins."
msgstr ""
"Vóór het dagelijkse gebruik structureren enkele basisinstellingen Resthome. "
"Ze gebeuren één keer en evolueren daarna nog nauwelijks."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:22
msgid "Application settings"
msgstr "De instellingen van de applicatie (Settings)"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:24
msgid ""
"The **Settings** menu brings together all the parameters, organized by tab. "
"For a nursing home, follow these guides — each one details **every field** "
"and its **recommended value**:"
msgstr ""
"Het menu **Instellingen** bundelt alle parameters, per tabblad. Voor een "
"woonzorgcentrum volgt u deze gidsen — elk beschrijft **elk veld** en de "
"**aanbevolen waarde**:"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:26
msgid "[General settings (residents, rooms)](reglages-generaux.md)"
msgstr "[Algemene instellingen (bewoners, kamers)](reglages-generaux.md)"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:27
msgid "[Billing settings](reglages-facturation.md)"
msgstr "[Facturatie-instellingen](reglages-facturation.md)"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:28
msgid "[Meals and nutrition settings](reglages-repas.md)"
msgstr "[Instellingen voor maaltijden en voeding](reglages-repas.md)"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:29
msgid "[Document settings](reglages-documents.md)"
msgstr "[Documentinstellingen](reglages-documents.md)"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:31
#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:49
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "In België"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:34
msgid ""
"The Belgian pack adds its own settings: the INAMI numbers and approvals of "
"the establishment, the INAMI rates and pseudo-codes, and the eHealth and "
"eFact credentials. See [Belgian settings](../belgique/reglages.md) and "
"[eHealth and eFact settings](../belgique/reglages-ehealth.md)."
msgstr ""
"Het Belgische pakket voegt zijn eigen instellingen toe: de RIZIV-nummers en "
"erkenningen van de instelling, de RIZIV-tarieven en pseudocodes, en de "
"eHealth- en eFact-toegangsgegevens. Zie [Belgische "
"instellingen](../belgique/reglages.md) en [eHealth- en eFact-"
"instellingen](../belgique/reglages-ehealth.md)."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:37
msgid "Rooms and sectors"
msgstr "Kamers en sectoren"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:39
msgid ""
"**Rooms**: create your rooms, with their **type** (single or double room, "
"the sector it belongs to…) and their **amenities**."
msgstr ""
"**Kamers**: maak uw kamers aan, met hun **type** (eenpersoons- of "
"tweepersoonskamer, de sector waartoe ze behoort…) en hun **uitrusting**."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:40
msgid "**Sectors / units**: group rooms by living unit."
msgstr "**Sectoren / eenheden**: groepeer de kamers per leefeenheid."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:41
msgid ""
"A room can be set to **maintenance**, **reserved**, or switched back to "
"**automatic** assignment based on occupancy."
msgstr ""
"Een kamer kan in **onderhoud** of **gereserveerd** gezet worden, of terug op"
" **automatische** toewijzing volgens de bezetting."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:43
msgid "Rates and packages"
msgstr "Tarieven en forfaits"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:45
msgid ""
"**Billing Rates**: the dated amounts Resthome bills — the accommodation "
"price (resident's share) and, where the country has one, the care allowance "
"paid by the health insurer."
msgstr ""
"**Factureringstarieven**: de gedateerde bedragen die Resthome factureert — "
"de huisvestingsprijs (bewonersgedeelte) en, waar het land er een kent, het "
"zorgforfait betaald door de zorgverzekeraar."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:46
msgid ""
"**Supplement types**: the catalog of billable services (see "
"[Supplements](../facturation/supplements.md))."
msgstr ""
"**Supplementtypes**: de catalogus van factureerbare prestaties (zie [De "
"supplementen](../facturation/supplements.md))."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:47
msgid ""
"**Absence discount rules**: the fine-tuning of billing when a resident is "
"away."
msgstr ""
"**Regels voor afwezigheidskorting**: de fijnafstelling van de facturatie "
"wanneer een bewoner afwezig is."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:52
msgid ""
"The rate menu is called **INAMI Rates** and carries the dependency allowance"
" per Katz category and sector, next to the **Billing Codes** (pseudo-codes)."
" See [Belgian settings](../belgique/reglages.md)."
msgstr ""
"Het tarievenmenu heet **RIZIV-tarieven** en bevat het "
"afhankelijkheidsforfait per Katz-categorie en per sector, naast de "
"**Facturatiecodes** (pseudocodes). Zie [Belgische "
"instellingen](../belgique/reglages.md)."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:55
msgid "Health insurers and reference data"
msgstr "Mutualiteiten en referentiegegevens"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:57
msgid ""
"**Health insurers**: the list of the residents' health insurers, used for "
"insurability checks and the electronic exchanges with the health insurer, "
"where the country has them."
msgstr ""
"**Zorgverzekeraars**: de lijst van de zorgverzekeraars van de bewoners, "
"gebruikt voor de verzekerbaarheidscontroles en de elektronische "
"uitwisselingen met de zorgverzekeraar, waar het land die kent."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:58
msgid ""
"**Facility**: your home's information (identifiers, contact details) used in"
" documents and in those exchanges."
msgstr ""
"**Instelling**: de gegevens van uw huis (identificatienummers, "
"contactgegevens) gebruikt in de documenten en in die uitwisselingen."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:60
msgid "Multi-company"
msgstr "Multi-vennootschap"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:62
msgid ""
"Resthome handles **multiple companies** in a single database: each company "
"has its own residents, rooms and billing, kept separate. Useful for a group "
"that operates several facilities."
msgstr ""
"Resthome beheert **meerdere vennootschappen** in eenzelfde database: elke "
"vennootschap heeft haar bewoners, haar kamers en haar facturatie, "
"afgeschermd. Nuttig voor een groep die meerdere instellingen uitbaat."

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:64
msgid "The activity log"
msgstr "Het activiteitenlogboek"

#: ../../content/configuration/index.md:67
msgid ""
"An **activity log** tracks access to sensitive data (GDPR). It can be viewed"
" from the configuration — useful for compliance."
msgstr ""
"Een **activiteitenlogboek** traceert de toegangen tot gevoelige gegevens "
"(GDPR). Het is raadpleegbaar vanuit de configuratie — nuttig voor de "
"compliance."

